{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1410535-master-builder-new-charm","id":1410535,"title":"Master Builder (new Charm)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-08-26T11:48:35-07:00","id":1410535,"title":"Master Builder (new Charm)","content":"<b>Master Builder</b><br /> <b>Cost:</b> - <b>Mins:</b> Craft 5, Essence 3<br /> <b>Type: </b>Permanent<br /> <b>Keywords: </b>None<br /> <b>Duration: </b>Permanent<br /> <b>Prerequisite Charms:</b> Words-as-Workshop Method<br /> <br /> A Solar with this Charm can apply its prerequisite and Craftsman Needs No Tools to non-Artifact superior projects. The exact manifestation is determined by the player's stunt description.<br /> <br /> Opinions and commentary?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-26T12:12:13-07:00","id":1410541,"title":"","content":"I wouldn't make this a Charm.<br /> <br /> 1) It's Craft, less Charms the better.<br /> <br /> 2) It would probably be better to, as much as possible, just house rule that any Craft Charm that only works on Minor and Major projects also works on Superior ones to build mundane things.<br /> <br /> 3) Words-as-Workshop Method already has the potential to let CNNT work with Superior and Legendary projects, though it's mostly at the ST's whims. So even more so than the general statement of #2 this feels like it should already be how WaWM works.<br /> <br /> So, basically, even if you're not concerned with #1 and #2 there, this is better as a clarification of WaWM than a separate Charm and more XP to spend.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-26T12:15:14-07:00","id":1410542,"title":"","content":"I'm not actually sure this charm needs to exist - I think that by the wording of Thousand-Forge Hands, it <i>already</i> speeds up mundane Superior craft projects. Thousand-Forge Hands doesn't specify it only works on artifacts, and the description of what it reduces the time to (6 - Essence) weeks for, &quot;all else&quot;, certainly suggests it applies. Personally, I feel that completing a Superior mundane project in no more than 4 weeks is already plenty fast.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Interested in chatting with other Exalted fans online? Join us on the <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kGsyF5jhdy\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted Discord server</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1533-kelly-pedersen","name":"Kelly Pedersen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"929"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-26T12:22:50-07:00","id":1410543,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1410535-master-builder-new-charm?p=1410541#post1410541\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">3) Words-as-Workshop Method already has the potential to let CNNT work with Superior and Legendary projects, though it's mostly at the ST's whims. So even more so than the general statement of #2 this feels like it should already be how WaWM works.</div> </div> </div> </div>Words-as-Wokshop Method explicitly says \u201csuperior or legendary Artifact projects,\u201d and CNNT explicitly states that it cannot be used with superior or legendary projects, Artifact or not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1184-ladylens","name":"LadyLens","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1132"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-26T13:23:12-07:00","id":1410555,"title":"","content":"I mean, do you really need a Charm to address the fact the WaWM seems to forget that mundane Superior projects exist?<br /> <br /> Between, as Kelly pointed out, Thousand-Forge Hands and the clause in WaWM that lets CNNT help on higher level projects than it normally allows... I don't see a reason for a Charm here instead of adjusting the existing Charms to be less poorly worded.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-28T17:42:18-07:00","id":1410909,"title":"","content":"Thousand-Forge Hands already covers non-magical superior+ projects on its own. There's nothing to be gained here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}